  "details": "My calendar is stuffed with regular (daily/weekly) events for various groups, which means I miss out on the events I actually want to go to. I'd like some way to keep those visible, while having more emphasis on important, irregular events, such as holiday events or parties.\n\nMajor events should probably be limited to 3 or maybe 4 per week, to prevent groups from making their daily schedules \"major events.\"",
